# pnpm settings (node-linker, peer-dependency strictness, workspace linking,
# lifecycle scripts, build-script allowlist) live in pnpm-workspace.yaml — pnpm
# 10+ reads them there, NOT from this file. Keep this .npmrc minimal so npm
# (invoked by the `cd app && npm run …` postinstall) doesn't warn about pnpm
# keys it doesn't understand.
